bindings.ldn, adapters.c, exports.h and bindings.json are generated by
refine bindings from Raspberry Pi's RP2040.h and system_RP2040.h,
BSD-3-Clause (devices/notices/LICENSE.pico-sdk), and Arm's CMSIS-Core
headers, Apache-2.0 (devices/notices/LICENSE-Apache-2.0.cmsis), as pinned in
devices/inputs.json; bindings/README.md says how to regenerate them.
